<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
<h2 id="h-why-vpcc" class="wp-block-heading has-xx-large-font-size"><strong>Why VPCC?</strong></h2>



<p class="has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph">There are a bunch of reasons to come to Virginia Peninsula from our <a href="/about/locations/">locations</a> to our amazing <a href="https://www.vpcc.edu/academics/programs/">programs</a> and <a href="https://www.vpcc.edu/admissions/transfer/">transfer options</a> — we have the right kind of higher education for everyone!</p>
