<div class="gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-05d59f43 gb-query-loop-item post-873881 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news tag-dual-enrollment tag-featured-story"><div class="gb-container gb-container-05d59f43">
<figure class="gb-block-image gb-block-image-68ff2fdc"><a href="https://www.vpcc.edu/news/newport-news-dual-enrollment-sparks-vpccs-enrollment-jump/"><img decoding="async" width="1600" height="900" data-src="https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-1600x900.jpg" class="gb-image-68ff2fdc lazyload" alt="Dual enrollment at VPCC was up 23% in headcount through October." data-srcset="https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-1600x900.jpg 1600w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-500x281.jpg 500w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-800x450.jpg 800w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story-1280x720.jpg 1280w, https://www.vpcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Photo-for-DE-story.jpg 1920w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 1600px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1600/900;" /></a></figure>

<h3 class="gb-headline gb-headline-c2dd3b20 gb-headline-text"><a href="https://www.vpcc.edu/news/newport-news-dual-enrollment-sparks-vpccs-enrollment-jump/">Newport News Dual Enrollment Sparks VPCC’s Enrollment Jump</a></h3>
